stream
BT /F1 16 Tf 72 720 Td (Information Security Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 690 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 674 Td (This policy defines the requirements for protecting company) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 658 Td (information assets against unauthorized access and disclosure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 642 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (2. Access Control) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 610 Td (Access is granted on a least-privilege basis and reviewed quarterly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 594 Td (Multi-factor authentication is mandatory for all remote access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 578 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 562 Td (3. Data Classification) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 546 Td (Data is classified as Public, Internal, Confidential, or Restricted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 530 Td (Restricted data must be encrypted at rest and in transit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 514 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 498 Td (4. Incident Response) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 482 Td (Security incidents must be reported to the security team within) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 466 Td (one hour of discovery and documented in the incident register.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 450 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 434 Td (5. Password Requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 418 Td (Passwords must be at least fourteen characters and rotated every) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 402 Td (ninety days. Reuse of the previous five passwords is prohibited.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 386 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 370 Td (6. Compliance) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 354 Td (Violations of this policy may result in disciplinary action.) Tj ET
endstream
